<title>USA: Colonial to buy Florida bank for $20.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Colonial to buy Florida bank for $20.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup said on Thursday it signed a letter of intent to acquire Great Southern Bancorp for $20.3 million in stock.</p>
<p>Colonial also will assume Great Southern's options based on the same price per Great Southern share used to calculate the acquisition -- $12.70.</p>
<p>With the options included the deal would be valued at $22 million.</p>
<p>Great Southern is a privately held bank in West Palm Beach, Fla., with $120 million in assets.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
